      <slug></slug>
      <title>Outside broadcast on a budget - the DebConf video team and DVswitch</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Debian</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We discuss the provisions of video coverage of &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.debconf.org/&#34;&gt;DebConf&lt;/a&gt; and Debian mini-conferences, starting in 2005. In particular, we describe the development of supporting software from simple scripts to a software video mixer and database of recordings with a web front-end.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
